# Accounting: FUTA calculator (simplified)

Load examples/hr/data/payroll_input.txt as Payroll Input

Find hours worked and save as hours_worked
Find hourly rate and save as hourly_rate

hours_worked equals 0 if hours_worked == nil
hourly_rate equals 0 if hourly_rate == nil

wages equals hours_worked times hourly_rate
futa_rate equals 0.006
futa_tax equals wages times futa_rate

wages must be at most 7000

Route futa_tax to accounting_tax_queue
